&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join one of the teams within SumUp’s Identity Lifecycle Mission, working on some of the most critical building blocks behind the merchant journey, from onboarding and identity verification to KYC/KYB, regulatory data collection, and managing customer identity throughout the entire lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, many of these capabilities live across different flows, legacy services, and tightly coupled integrations. We’re on a journey to bring these pieces together into a more coherent, scalable platform, with shared data models, reusable services, and clear ownership boundaries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Backend Engineer, you won’t just be maintaining existing systems. You’ll have the opportunity to shape how our identity platform evolves, modernise critical services, and help build foundations that can support new regulations, markets, and product requirements without reinventing the wheel every time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be part of one dedicated team, but the challenges we tackle often cross team and domain boundaries. You’ll work closely with Engineers, Product, Design, Compliance, Risk, and Operations, giving you the opportunity to influence solutions well beyond your own team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you enjoy solving complex backend problems, working in a highly collaborative environment, improving reliability, and building scalable capabilities that enable other teams to move faster, this could be an exciting opportunity to make a real impact at SumUp.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and operate scalable backend services, APIs, event-driven workflows, and system integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable capabilities that power merchant onboarding, identity verification, and KYC/KYB regulatory data collection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive reliability and resilience across critical services through better observability, failure handling, incident response, and long-term risk reduction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work primarily with Go, while maintaining and progressively modernising existing services written in Java.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve domain models and service boundaries while reducing legacy complexity, duplicated logic, and tightly coupled integrations, always with a pragmatic, incremental mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own your work end-to-end, from technical design and implementation to rollout and production follow-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across team and domain boundaries, turning ambiguous product and regulatory requirements into clear, scalable technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review code and designs, mentor engineers, and help raise engineering standards across the mission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll be great for this role if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong professional experience building and operating production backend systems with high business impact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Go and Java and confidence in maintaining and evolving existing Java services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of API design, distributed systems, asynchronous processing, data modelling, testing, and system design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with event streaming platforms such as Kafka and modern observability tools such as Grafana or Honeycomb.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience deploying and operating services in cloud environments such as AWS, ideally with Docker and Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong ownership mindset, with the ability to take complex problems from definition through to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience improving the reliability of business-critical systems and turning recurring incidents into lasting engineering improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and a collaborative approach to working across Engineering, Product, Compliance, Risk, and Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in fintech, payments, KYC/KYB, identity verification, or regulatory systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience translating regulatory and compliance requirements into clear, scalable engineering solutions, while helping bridge the gap between Compliance and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join SumUp:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌍 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on large-scale fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Berlin office. This involves an office-first setup&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧑‍🔬 We take learning and experimentation seriously with Hack Days every second Friday, and entire &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FBKiVCLompk&quot;&gt;global Hack Weeks&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: Be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2,000 for attending conferences and/or advancing your career through further education&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our VSOP program: You will own a stake in SumUp’s future success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💶 A corporate pension scheme where we match up to 20% of your contributions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔄 30 Days Sabbatical: Enjoy the unique opportunity to take a well-deserved break with our 30 days sabbatical benefit after completing 3 years of employment with SumUp&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: Earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚵🏾‍♂️ Numerous other benefits such as Urban Sports Club subsidy, Kita placement assistance, relocation assistance, subsidised office lunches&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;SumUp is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer that proudly pursues and hires a diverse workforce. SumUp does not make hiring or employment decisions on the basis of race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by Company policy. SumUp also strives for a healthy and safe workplace and strictly prohibits harassment of any kind.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 36 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in our diverse team of over 3,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot;&gt;Our core values&lt;/a&gt; lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Explore career opportunities with us and join a team driven by collaboration, innovation, and a shared vision of creating a world where everyone can build a thriving business. Discover more about our vibrant and inclusive work culture and how we work on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot;&gt;careers website&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;You’re a privacy expert who knows how to navigate global regulations without slowing down innovation.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;You thrive on translating dense legal frameworks into practical guidance for technical teams. If you want to build scalable data protection strategies that actually make sense, this is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About JetBrains&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We create intelligent software development tools for developers and teams. More than 15 million users, over 300,000 companies, and 88 of the Fortune Global Top 100 rely on our products to solve real, complex problems. Our mission is simple: make development teams more productive and AI adoptable at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As data privacy and AI regulations rapidly evolve, ensuring our tools and operations remain compliant is more critical than ever. &lt;strong&gt;In this role, you’ll take ownership of our privacy-by-design initiatives, shaping how we handle data across our international operations.&lt;/strong&gt; You will influence how product features are built and how cross-border data transfers are structured, ensuring we meet regulatory standards without adding unnecessary friction. Working closely with engineering, AI, security, and HR teams, you’ll turn legal requirements into actionable advice. As Senior Legal Counsel on our Regulatory and Data Privacy team, you’ll be instrumental in modernizing our compliance frameworks and finding ways to use automation to make our legal processes smarter and more predictable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Day to day, you will:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise cross-functional groups (including AI, security, HR, and engineering) on data privacy and regulatory compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate product features, global data governance, and cross-border transfer mechanisms (like DPAs and SCCs) for privacy-by-design compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft, review, and maintain internal and external data protection agreements, privacy policies, and terms of service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Map our data flows and technical operations to ensure they fit within a coherent global regulatory framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research international regulatory shifts and prepare clear, structured legal memos and comparative analyses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and improve legal templates, guidance, DSAR processes, and knowledge databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot and assess legal risks related to new technology laws, technical product design, and data processing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive process improvements within the team to boost efficiency, incorporating AI and automation tools where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high degree of adaptability when dealing with novel technical concepts and evolving foreign laws.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to translate complex legal jargon into clear, practical advice that engineers and product teams can easily use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A lateral, creative approach to problem-solving, backed by thorough research and critical thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive mindset and the ability to navigate complex environments and independently manage competing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong interest in optimizing processes and exploring how automation can improve legal workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transparency, honesty, and a collaborative approach to working within a global team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least &lt;strong&gt;8 years of post-qualification legal experience&lt;/strong&gt; focused primarily on data privacy, technology law, or digital regulatory compliance, including &lt;strong&gt;substantial experience as in-house counsel advising on privacy and data protection matters within an international technology company&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of successfully implementing EU data protection regulations (GDPR, ePrivacy) into company processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A completed university-level degree in law.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in written and spoken English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to draft clear, legally sound privacy policies, terms of service, and regulatory risk assessments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role means earning the trust of product and engineering teams by giving them clear, actionable legal guidance that helps them move forward. You will have successfully streamlined our data privacy compliance processes, leaving systems better and more automated than you found them. Ultimately, you’ll ensure that JetBrains continues to innovate rapidly while maintaining a robust, compliant, and globally scalable data governance framework.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join JetBrains?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong base salary. We offer competitive pay that reflects your skills and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work location. Enjoy the freedom to work from home or from the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote work. Spend up to 30 days per year working remotely from abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extra time off. More days to relax, recharge, and do the things you love.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical insurance allowance. Enjoy peace of mind for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities. Access to conferences, courses, and language classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language classes. Pick up the local language or sharpen your English skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fuel your day. Enjoy a hot meal or receive a lunch allowance on workdays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health support. To help you feel your best, we provide easy access to professional mental health services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sports benefit. Enjoy an on-site gym or sports club stipend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal events. Join company-wide celebrations and team gatherings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Some benefits may vary depending on location.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If this sounds like you, we invite you to apply.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-TA2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace – one that welcomes everyone regardless of their background, identity, religion, age, accessibility needs, or orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We process the data provided in your job application in accordance with the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/privacy/privacy-recruitment/&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;You understand that good legal counsel doesn’t just mitigate risk. It also fosters innovation. Comfortable navigating the gray areas of new technology, you enjoy finding pragmatic paths forward and building frameworks that help teams move faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About JetBrains&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We create intelligent software development tools for developers and teams. More than 15 million users, over 300,000 companies, and 88 of the Fortune Global Top 100 rely on our products to solve real, complex problems. Our mission is simple: make development teams more productive and AI adoptable at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we expand our AI initiatives and explore new commercial models, the legal landscape in which we operate is becoming more complex. &lt;strong&gt;We are looking for a Senior Legal Counsel to join the Product and Business Development legal team. &lt;/strong&gt;This role isn&#39;t about saying &quot;no&quot;; it&#39;s about figuring out &quot;how.&quot; You’ll shape scalable legal frameworks that support product innovation, strategic partnerships, and sustainable growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work closely with the Product, Go-to-Market, Business Development, Marketplace, and University Relations teams, helping them understand and navigate regulatory realities while keeping the focus on user value. &lt;strong&gt;You’ll own the legal life cycle of new offerings and partnerships, collaborating with a team of experienced lawyers to solve problems no one has solved before.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Day to day, you will:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on the entire life cycle of software products, services, plugins, and AI features - from refining early concepts to retiring older features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement legal and regulatory requirements, including AI regulation and consumer protection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft, negotiate, and advise on strategic tech, AI partnership, and collaboration agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support JetBrains Marketplace initiatives and relationships with third-party platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide the legal aspects of our educational, academic, and research initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve legal operations by designing templates, playbooks, and self-service resources that reduce the need for manual legal review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equip the sales and procurement legal teams with product expertise to help them negotiate customer and vendor agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share knowledge and insights across the legal team and broader business to build awareness around best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A pragmatic approach to problem-solving, balancing legal risk with business realities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to explain complex legal concepts clearly and simply to non-lawyers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong ownership mentality, seeing matters through from start to finish.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort making decisions in ambiguous environments, especially regarding novel technologies like AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset, working well with stakeholders across different teams and disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A continuous drive to improve workflows, automating or standardizing routine tasks where possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transparency, integrity, and the willingness to speak up when something doesn’t make sense.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A formal degree in law (LLB, LLM, Mgr, or equivalent).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An extensive background advising multinational corporations on technology and commercial law.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of successfully drafting and negotiating sophisticated commercial and technology agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep understanding of software products, digital services, and technology business models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English and the ability to negotiate and draft complex legal documents clearly and effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The demonstrated ability to manage multiple complex tasks and stakeholder relationships simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success means you’ll have become a trusted advisor to our product and business teams. You don’t just review contracts. You are actively involved in the strategy, ensuring legal frameworks are an enabler of growth rather than a bottleneck. Over time, you will have established clear, scalable self-service resources that allow teams to handle routine legal questions independently, freeing you up to focus on high-impact, complex challenges. You’ll leave things cleaner and more efficient than you found them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join JetBrains?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong base salary. We offer competitive pay that reflects your skills and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work location. Enjoy the freedom to work from home or from the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote work. Spend up to 30 days per year working remotely from abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extra time off. More days to relax, recharge, and do the things you love.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical insurance allowance. Enjoy peace of mind for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities. Access to conferences, courses, and language classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language classes. Pick up the local language or sharpen your English skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fuel your day. Enjoy a hot meal or receive a lunch allowance on workdays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health support. To help you feel your best, we provide easy access to professional mental health services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sports benefit. Enjoy an on-site gym or sports club stipend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal events. Join company-wide celebrations and team gatherings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Some benefits may vary depending on location.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-TA2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace – one that welcomes everyone regardless of their background, identity, religion, age, accessibility needs, or orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
