&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Senior Project Manager in the ANZ Special Ops team, you will act as an in-house consultant, working on solving the business&#39;s most complex and operationally important problems from scoping to delivering results and embedding them in BAU. These projects usually span multiple departments and require cross-functional communication, analytical problem-solving, and a continuous-improvement mindset to elevate the HelloFresh business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This 12 month contract&amp;nbsp; is based in Chippendale, Sydney&amp;nbsp; and reports to the Associate Director Special Ops.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, contribute to, and project manage complex operational and strategic initiatives aimed at meeting the strategic objectives of HelloFresh.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Originate and develop complex projects that will have a positive impact on our teams, product, customers, suppliers, revenue, and costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with our Senior Management Team, C-Suite, and Global stakeholders to spearhead innovation projects focused on scaling our operations and expanding the customer offering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product managers and operations champions to assess initial feasibility of new products and projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead or support full operational scoping, monitor implementation, and guide roadmap planning for new products and projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve our operational processes and tools used.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with global stakeholders on best practices for implementing projects and market performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or Master&#39;s in Business, Supply Chain, or Procurement (or equivalent).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of project management experience, preferably in food or management consulting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mastery of technical skills, with the ability to independently apply project management frameworks and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quantitative and analytical experience, including solid comfort with Google Slides and Sheets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong up and downward management skills with clear communication (written and oral equally).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in AI literacy is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data analytics platforms (such as SQL, Tableau, Databricks, or PowerBI) is highly regarded.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, ambitious, and assertive: you take ownership of your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equipped with a &quot;roll up sleeves&quot; attitude to enter workstreams and get them over the line.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll get in return...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to have a significant impact in a leading global food technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working arrangements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Egoless environment, constant learning with room for personal growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free access to Headspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal learning &amp;amp; development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A diverse and vibrant international environment, with offices in 18 countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company discount - 70% off HelloFresh &amp;amp; 40% off Youfoodz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start Date:&lt;/strong&gt; Immediately available - Can wait a notice period&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration :&lt;/strong&gt;12 month Fixed Term Contract&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Chippendale Head Office - hybrid working environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive salary &amp;amp; employee benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the &lt;strong&gt;Senior Systems Enablement Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, you will own the end-to-end enablement strategy and delivery of complex, high-impact technology systems across our ANZ operational landscape. Operating with high autonomy, you will lead deep-dive gap analyses to tailor global system blueprints to local market needs, drive technical readiness workstreams, and shape the Launch Team’s playbooks and capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in &lt;strong&gt;Sydney, Australia&lt;/strong&gt; and reporting to the &lt;strong&gt;Launch Team Lead - ANZ&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end strategy, scope, and delivery of complex, high-impact system launches across the ANZ region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage project plans, timelines, and RAID logs, proactively mitigating risks and managing cross-functional dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead deep-dive gap analyses comparing global tech blueprints against local ANZ requirements, challenging proposals with data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own technical readiness workstreams by partnering with local Operations, Global VSM teams, and Global Tech Squads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute rollout training strategies, tracking system adoption rates and minimizing manual workarounds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead hypercare periods for high-risk launches, coordinating rapid issue resolution and conducting post-launch reviews to drive continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a key interface representing ANZ market needs to Global Product &amp;amp; Tech teams while managing local and global stakeholder relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of project management theories, concepts, methodologies, and launch interdependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience independently managing projects in Supply Chain / Operational teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great organisation skills with the ability to manage multiple projects without compromising delivery timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in adapting communication styles to manage multi level, cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail with demonstrated ability to analyse data for decision making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly autonomous with strong decision-making skills and the confidence to hold approval authority on technical readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative problem-solver who excels at managing uncertainty and developing successful operational solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An exceptional communicator, capable of credibly representing market needs to global teams &amp;amp; confident in leading meetings/training sessions with local teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team player who enjoys elevating team capabilities, refining playbooks, and establishing operational best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to have a significant impact in a leading global food technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working arrangements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Egoless environment, constant learning with room for personal growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free access to Headspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HelloFresh Academies - internal learning &amp;amp; development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A diverse and vibrant international environment, with offices in 18 countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company discount - 70% off HelloFresh &amp;amp; 40% off Youfoodz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start Date: &lt;/strong&gt;Immediately available - Can wait a notice period&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration: &lt;/strong&gt;Permanent full time role&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Chippendale Head Office&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary: &lt;/strong&gt;Competitive salary &amp;amp; employee benefits&lt;/p&gt;
